                "message": "Stop loading sp-ai at startup and add sp-ai-load\n\nsp-ai took 12 to 16 s of start-up, most of it Elpaca installing and\nconfiguring the AI packages. It is no longer in the default module list;\nM-x sp-ai-load loads it on demand and waits for Elpaca.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
